# Custom flow so the RAG answer runs inside Nemo's engine.
#
# Nemo only applies the input/output rails declared in config.yml when a request
# goes through its engine. This flow makes the RAG step (registered in
# rails.py as the "GenerateRagAnswer" action) the bot turn, so:
#   - self check input  runs on the user message before the action
#   - self check output runs on the answer before it is returned
flow user ask
  $answer = await GenerateRagAnswer()
  bot $answer